<http://data.silknow.org/object/27dc5a99-c366-354c-b100-bfaa94ec19ec>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "MANDARIN SQUARE (pair).\nSecond Rank Civil:  Golden Pheasant.\nCHINESE:  (late Ch'ing dynasty).\nEmbroidered in silk and gold thread. []"@en , "Pair of uncut mandarin badges embroidered with silk and gilt threads, China, late 19th century"@en , "Pair of uncut square mandarin rank badges embroidered with coloured silks in satin, split, long and short stem stitches and laid and couched work, with laid and couched gold thread and some sequins.\n\nOn each badge is embroidered a golden pheasant, the insignia of a civil official of the second rank, with a background of water, waves, rocks, clouds and miscellaneous symbols."@en ;
        ecrm:P138i_has_representation  <http://data.silknow.org/image/35e5d2ad-6e87-366f-b59c-b1d88900bcff> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/e6e9ec81-82d2-346b-b436-0671ed469749> , <http://data.silknow.org/image/c27a918a-749f-3cf4-a967-568d9d263f74> ;
        ecrm:P3_has_note               "Pair of uncut mandarin badges embroidered with silk and gilt threads, China, late 19th century"@en , "Pair of uncut square mandarin rank badges embroidered with coloured silks in satin, split, long and short stem stitches and laid and couched work, with laid and couched gold thread and some sequins.\n\nOn each badge is embroidered a golden pheasant, the insignia of a civil official of the second rank, with a background of water, waves, rocks, clouds and miscellaneous symbols."@en , "MANDARIN SQUARE (pair).\nSecond Rank Civil:  Golden Pheasant.\nCHINESE:  (late Ch'ing dynasty).\nEmbroidered in silk and gold thread. []"@en ;
